      "text": "Match_requests : TABLE\n\nproperties:\n\n\nid : \nBIGSERIAL \nPRIMARY KEY \n\n\n(FOREIGNKEY)sender_id:\nBIGINT\nNOT NULL\nREFERENCES Users.id\n\n(FOREIGNKEY)receiver_id:\nBIGINT\nNOT NULL\nREFERENCES Users.id\n\nstate:\nVARCHAR(8)\nNOT NULL\nCHECK(state = 'Accepted' or state =\n'Rejected' or state = 'Pending')\n\n(FOREINGKEY) match_id :\nBIGINT\nUNIQUE\nREFERENCES Matches.id\n\nanswer_time:\nTIMESTAMPTZ\n\nsent_time:\nTIMESTAMPTZ",
