      "text": "Wordles : TABLE\n\nproperties:\n\n\nid:\nBIGSERIAL\nPRIMARY KEY\n\n\n(FOREIGNKEY)player_id:\nBIGINT\nNOT NULL\nREFERENCES Users.id\n\nprogress : \nINT\nNOT NULL\nDEFUALT 0\n\nstate:\nVARCHAR(10)\nNOT NULL\nCHECK(state ='InProgress' or state =\n'Finished'\n\nfinish_time:\nTIMESTAMPTZ\n\n(FOREGINKEY)match_id:\nBIGINT\nNOT NULL\nREFERENCES Matches.id\n\nresult:\n\nVARCHAR(4)\nCHECK(result ='WIN' or result = 'TIE' or\nresult ='LOSE')\n\n\n\n",
